{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and take the object if approached. Otherwise move to it. Check and do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
    "BT": {
